ry, a book that controls who can use magic.\n\nTo save her lover, Mira used her position inside the Arcanum to slow the process.\nBut she is already beginning to forget Sera.\n\nTheir last chance is a two-person heist: Sera must break into The Chancery and open the Registry chamber so Mira can change her page.\nBut can they complete the perfect heist before Mira forgets who she is trying to save?", "summary": "A real-time deckbuilder with no turns. Enemies cast live, the clock never stops, and every card you play is a split-second decision. Cast wisely and react fast.\n\nYour deck is the plan, but timing decides whether it works. Don't have the spell you need? Steal it from someone who does.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/kleptomagia", "videos": [{"id": 203723, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "znMUpwEFH9A", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=znMUpwEFH9A", "title": "KleptoMagia - Trailer | DEMO OUT NOW", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/znMUpwEFH9A/fhddefault.jpg"}]}